Infrastructure: Gates

Purpose:
  Defines infrastructure and deployment gates.

GateSchema:
  Format: INFRA-GATE-<ID>
  Condition: <infrastructure criterion>
  Evidence: <validation result>
  Threshold: <pass/fail criteria>
  Owner: DevOps
  Decision: PASS / FAIL

GateTypes:
  Docker:
    Condition: Docker build succeeds
  CICD:
    Condition: CI/CD pipeline passes
  Secrets:
    Condition: No secrets in infrastructure config
  Networking:
    Condition: Network config valid
  Healthcheck:
    Condition: Health checks pass
  Backup:
    Condition: Backup strategy validated
  Monitoring:
    Condition: Monitoring configured
  Logging:
    Condition: Logging configured

DeploymentGates:
  Local: Direct deployment
  Staging: Rolling deployment
  Production: Canary / Blue-Green based on scale

Rules:
  [IF1] Infrastructure gates are environment-specific.
  [IF2] Production has strictest infrastructure gates.
  [IF3] Health checks MUST pass before traffic routing.
  [IF4] Backup and monitoring MUST be verified before production deploy.

State: +